        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chino Moreno, Sergio Vega\n- Bands: Deftones, Team Sleep, Crosses, Saudade, Palms\n- Songs: \"Tempest\"\n- Albums: \"Koi No Yokan\"\n- Places: Sacramento, California\n- Websites: PureVolume\n\nFacts:\n- Deftones is a Sacramento, California-based alternative metal band.\n- \"Tempest\" is the second single by Deftones from the band's seventh studio album \"Koi No Yokan.\"\n- On October 3, 2012, PureVolume's official website debuted the song \"Tempest\" along with a video featuring Chino Moreno and Sergio Vega discussing the track.\n- Chino Moreno is also a member of the side-project groups Team Sleep, Crosses, Saudade, and Palms.",
